		(uuid "32f3bf10-e87f-4386-b095-46ab46969c79")
	)
	(text "RT is open: nominal switching frequency is 400 kHz. MODE is grounded: PFM is\nallowed at light load. C803 (22 nF) extends soft-start. L801 (6.8 uH) and\nC808-C813 (6 x 47 uF) filter FPGA_RAW; C814 shapes the feedback response."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 90.5 0)
		(effects
