		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b76aad50-4d5e-4de9-9d5a-022330e9e5c7")
	)
	(text "R805 (0.01 Ohm) causes a 10 mV/A drop. Feedback and PG_FPGA refer to FPGA_RAW\nbefore the shunt. U801 is a 5 A IC with internal current, short-circuit and\nthermal protection. At 5 A, R805 dissipates 0.25 W: verify thermal margin.\nD801 indicates rail presence."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8d6d17c-7249-470e-84b6-964ff162b16f")
	)
	(text "Purpose and role"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bc0ae3f0-3c5d-49ae-80c2-8bd14f0a4c6c")
	)
	(text "CMD_FPGA drives EN through Q801.\nPG_FPGA is pulled up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92 33.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c40d2f6f-6603-4c7b-baae-e151b81002b1")
	)
	(text "R803 (100 kOhm) and R804 (22.1 kOhm) set FPGA_RAW:\nVRAW = VREF x (1 + R803/R804).\nWith VREF = 1 V, VRAW = 5.525 V (5.558 V using the typical 1.006 V PWM\nreference). To change voltage: R803 = R804 x (VRAW/VREF - 1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ceff6e3d-30aa-4fe7-a562-b9f291fa732e")
	)
	(text "FPGA intermediate supply, approximately 5.5 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 26.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.35 2.35)
				(thickness 0.18)
